# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - The only accuracy table is on melting temperature (Table II, ten materials against reference values): raw uMLIP MAE / RMSE of 177.8 / 268.0 K (DPA-3.2-5M-OMat24), 198.8 / 277.4 K (Allegro-OAM-L) and 326.6 / 385.4 K (MACE-MPA-0), with per-material signed errors. Schema 0.1.2 has no MetricProperty for a melting temperature and no unit K, so nothing is encoded; none of the three checkpoints is a registry model yet (Table I gives their deployed labels, which would pin them).
# - Coexistence MD with a pretrained model would be a mlips:supportsSimulation statement, but the paper applies no method in a training run, so nothing is asserted. Read from the arXiv v1 preprint.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).
